10
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.380
Let me set it up for you.
让我来给你们介绍一下背景。

11
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:26.700
Okay.
好的。

12
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.600
So remember how Jan is bringing in fabrics for Michael to look at?
还记得简带了些布料让迈克尔看吗？

13
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.140
Yes, she's spending like all his money on redecorating.
记得，她几乎花光了他所有的钱来重新装修。

14
00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.180
The condo, yes.
