19
00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.120
And I thought you should hear who he's talking about.
我觉得你们应该听听他说的是谁。

20
00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.720
You know who loves interior design?
你知道谁喜欢室内设计吗？

21
