29
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.560
Because in the pilot, isn't it the pilot, Todd Packer calls and says, ask her if the carpet matches the drapes.
因为在试播集中，是不是试播集来着，托德·帕克打电话来说，问她地毯和窗帘配不配。

30
00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:29.540
