41
00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:48.700
He probably also has a waterbed or a, like, a round bed.
他可能还有个水床，或者那种圆形的床。

42
00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:49.880
He has a waterbed.
他肯定有水床。

43
00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:50.380
Yes.
没错。

44
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.800
