里面有好多有趣的迈克尔访谈片段。

141
00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.900
I thought I'd share two alts, okay?
我想分享两个备选片段，好吗？

142
00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.300
Remember when Michael shares that he and Jan are down to only one car?
还记得迈克尔说他和简现在只剩一辆车了吗？

143
00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:59.880
And, you know, they did this to save money.
你知道，他们这么做是为了省钱。

144
00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.400
But then, of course, Jan wanted a Porsche.
但当然，简想要一辆保时捷。

145
00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:03.180
Yes.
是的。

146
00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:06.120
So she's driving a Porsche, but they only have one car.
所以她在开保时捷，但他们只有一辆车。

147
00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.340
Well, there were two alts for this talking head and they cracked me up.
这个访谈片段有两个备选，把我逗乐了。

148
00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.160
Jan and I are sharing a car now.
简和我现在共用一辆车。

149
