01:02:29.590 --> 01:02:30.790
I thought it was perfect.
我觉得非常完美。

1391
01:02:31.070 --> 01:02:35.490
Everything he said as an actor, he just sort of threw it away, you know?
作为演员，他说的每一句话都处理得轻描淡写，你懂吗？

1392
01:02:35.650 --> 01:02:38.570
And I just thought he was a phenomenal actor.
我觉得他是一位了不起的演员。

1393
01:02:38.570 --> 01:02:41.210
And I just thought he crushed all of his scenes.
我觉得他演活了所有的戏份。

1394
01:02:41.210 --> 01:02:42.430
And it was so believable.
而且非常真实可信。

1395
01:02:42.990 --> 01:02:46.390
Vikram is eating mixed masala and eggplant and rice.
维克拉姆正在吃混合玛萨拉、茄子和米饭。

1396
01:02:46.510 --> 01:02:47.870
His dinner looks amazing.
他的晚餐看起来棒极了。

1397
01:02:47.870 --> 01:02:49.690
And it looks like it was prepared with love.
而且看起来是用心准备的。

1398
01:02:49.690 --> 01:02:52.170
And it's in all these little nice containers.
装在所有这些精致的小盒子里。

1399
01:02:52.630 --> 01:02:55.910
And Michael is having a vanilla crisp bar.
而迈克尔在吃一根香草脆饼棒。

1400
01:02:57.090 --> 01:02:58.650
Which is a real thing.
那可是真实存在的东西。

1401
01:02:58.810 --> 01:02:59.630
It's a power bar.
这是一个电源插线板。

1402
01:03:00.010 --> 01:03:00.070
Yeah.
是啊。

1403
01:03:00.330 --> 01:03:00.450
Yeah.
没错。

1404
01:03:00.930 --> 01:03:06.030
But what you see is that, you know, well, Jan doesn't know where Michael is, but she certainly
但你看，简不知道迈克尔在哪儿，但她肯定

1405
01:03:06.030 --> 01:03:08.370
hasn't sent him to work with a lovely meal.
没有给他准备一份爱心午餐让他带去上班。

1406
01:03:08.630 --> 01:03:09.110
No.
没有。

1407
01:03:09.110 --> 01:03:11.370
The way Vikram's partner clearly has.
不像维克拉姆的搭档那样，显然准备了。

1408
01:03:11.530 --> 01:03:15.290
Ranjit, very sadly, he passed away in April of last year.
兰吉特很不幸，他在去年四月去世了。

1409
01:03:15.490 --> 01:03:17.170
He was so great to work with.
和他共事真是太棒了。

1410
01:03:17.290 --> 01:03:19.750
And guys, he's going to come back for another episode.
伙计们，他还会回来客串另一集。

1411
01:03:20.200 --> 01:03:26.390
You might remember, he is part of Michael's dream team when Michael starts the Michael Scott
你们可能还记得，当迈克尔创办迈克尔·斯科特

1412
01:03:26.390 --> 01:03:27.170
paper company.
造纸公司时，他是迈克尔梦之队的一员。

1413
01:03:27.170 --> 01:03:30.310
So I got to work with him when he came back.
所以他回来的时候，我有幸和他一起工作。

1414
01:03:30.610 --> 01:03:35.090
And I got a few facts on him because I just thought he was so wonderful.
我搜集了一些关于他的资料，因为我觉得他真是太棒了。

1415
01:03:35.390 --> 01:03:39.850
You know, his mother was a theater teacher and an actress.
你知道，他的母亲是一位戏剧老师兼演员。

1416
01:03:40.190 --> 01:03:42.570
His stepfather was a theater director.
他的继父是一位戏剧导演。

1417
01:03:42.890 --> 01:03:47.810
And he just, he worked his whole life as an actor and a writer.
他一生都在从事演员和编剧的工作。

1418
01:03:48.710 --> 01:03:53.630
And he just had this very long career as an artist and comes from a long line of artists.
他作为艺术家有着非常漫长的职业生涯，而且出身于艺术世家。

1419
01:03:53.630 --> 01:03:55.210
So he's just amazing.
所以他真的很了不起。

1420
01:03:55.450 --> 01:03:57.390
I loved watching him in his scenes.
我喜欢看他演的戏。

1421
01:03:57.550 --> 01:03:58.290
I agree.
我同意。

1422
01:03:58.710 --> 01:04:03.810
Well, after they have dinner, Michael is sort of holding court with the other telemarketers.
好吧，吃完晚饭后，迈克尔在其他电话推销员面前侃侃而谈。

1423
01:04:04.090 --> 01:04:05.090
They love him.
他们很喜欢他。

1424
01:04:05.250 --> 01:04:08.650
He's talking about Die Hard and how Die Hard won the original.
他在谈论《虎胆龙威》，以及《虎胆龙威》是如何赢得最初的赞誉的。

1425
01:04:09.150 --> 01:04:10.650
John McClane was just this normal guy.
约翰·麦克莱恩只是个普通人。

1426
01:04:10.810 --> 01:04:12.890
You know, he's just a New York City cop.
你知道，他只是个纽约市警察。

1427
01:04:13.170 --> 01:04:15.830
And then he gets his feet cut and gets beat up.
然后他的脚被割伤了，还被打了一顿。

1428
01:04:16.190 --> 01:04:19.270
Jenna, I had just watched Die Hard over the holidays.
珍娜，我假期刚看了《虎胆龙威》。

1429
01:04:19.270 --> 01:04:22.510
We were picking Christmas movies and it's a kind of a great Christmas movie.
我们在选圣诞电影，它算是一部很棒的圣诞电影。

1430
01:04:22.510 --> 01:04:24.750
It's one of my favorite Christmas movies.
它是我最喜欢的圣诞电影之一。

1431
01:04:25.170 --> 01:04:27.930
And right out of the gate, Josh turns to me and goes,
刚开始没多久，乔什就转过头对我说：

1432
01:04:28.110 --> 01:04:30.570
I would have put my shoes on the minute I heard gunfire.
“我一听到枪声就会立刻穿上鞋子。”

1433
01:04:30.690 --> 01:04:31.750
I would have put my shoes on.
“我肯定会穿上鞋子的。”

1434
01:04:32.550 --> 01:04:37.690
This was a really hard thing for Josh to get past that this guy had no shoes on for like the whole movie.
乔什很难接受这一点，就是这家伙整部电影几乎都没穿鞋。

1435
01:04:37.890 --> 01:04:44.410
And also, he takes the shoes off this enormously tall Nordic guy, right?
而且，他还脱掉了那个身材高大的北欧人的鞋子，对吧？

1436
01:04:44.490 --> 01:04:45.330
He's just died.
那个人刚死。

1437
01:04:45.870 --> 01:04:46.570
Massive dude.
个头很大。

1438
01:04:46.910 --> 01:04:48.610
And he's like, shoes are too small.
他说，鞋子太小了。

1439
01:04:48.810 --> 01:04:51.010
And we're like, okay, we're going to call BS on that.
我们当时就觉得，好吧，这太扯了。

1440
01:04:51.010 --> 01:04:56.250
But there's no way that dude's feet are smaller than yours, Bruce Willis.
那个人的脚不可能比你的还小，布鲁斯·威利斯。

1441
01:04:56.390 --> 01:04:56.930
What's happening?
这到底是怎么回事？

1442
01:04:57.750 --> 01:04:57.890
Yeah.
是啊。

1443
01:04:58.330 --> 01:05:02.970
Well, you know, and then the thing happens in this movie that's real hard for me,
嗯，你知道，电影里还有一件事让我很难受，

1444
01:05:03.090 --> 01:05:08.170
where he gets the piece of glass in his foot and he does not take care of that properly.
就是他的脚扎进了玻璃碎片，但他没有好好处理。

1445
01:05:08.170 --> 01:05:09.350
He just does not.
他根本没处理。

1446
01:05:09.590 --> 01:05:09.910
No.
确实没有。

1447
01:05:10.530 --> 01:05:15.430
I mean, I know he doesn't have a lot of options, but that kind of stuff, it just, ooh.
我是说，我知道他没太多选择，但那种事，真的，噢。

1448
01:05:16.010 --> 01:05:16.970
It gets you.
看着就疼。

1449
01:05:17.230 --> 01:05:21.810
Well, anyway, everyone is loving Michael's theory on Die Hard and the Die Hard series.
总之，大家都很喜欢迈克尔关于《虎胆龙威》及其系列的理论。

1450
01:05:22.290 --> 01:05:25.710
And one of the co-workers is like, dude, you should review movies.
其中一个同事说，伙计，你应该去当影评人。

1451
01:05:25.850 --> 01:05:26.470
They're like, yeah.
他们就说，是啊。

1452
01:05:26.890 --> 01:05:29.110
And then Michael's like, actually, I'm writing a movie.
然后迈克尔就说，其实，我正在写一部电影。

1453
01:05:30.130 --> 01:05:30.490
Yeah.
是啊。

1454
01:05:30.690 --> 01:05:31.750
Threat Level Midnight.
《威胁等级：午夜》。

1455
01:05:31.990 --> 01:05:32.170
Yeah.
是啊。

1456
01:05:32.270 --> 01:05:32.930
And they're like, oh.
然后他们就说，哦。

1457
01:05:33.590 --> 01:05:33.990
Ooh.
噢。

1458
01:05:33.990 --> 01:05:40.550
But I just think it's so incredibly charming that Michael is like, he's the cool dude.
但我就是觉得迈克尔那种觉得自己是个酷哥的样子特别迷人。

1459
01:05:40.890 --> 01:05:41.610
I know.
我知道。

1460
01:05:41.890 --> 01:05:42.930
He's the cool dude at this place.
他是这儿的酷哥。

1461
01:05:43.230 --> 01:05:44.030
I know.
我知道。

1462
01:05:44.250 --> 01:05:51.650
Well, back at Shroop Farms, Pam hears a very strange knocking noise.
话说回到施鲁特农场，帕姆听到了一种非常奇怪的敲击声。

1463
01:05:51.910 --> 01:05:53.490
She decides to investigate.
她决定去一探究竟。

1464
01:05:54.150 --> 01:05:56.930
And it's Moe's in an outhouse.
结果发现是摩斯在茅房里。

1465
01:05:57.230 --> 01:05:58.010
An outhouse.
一个茅房。

1466
01:05:58.150 --> 01:05:59.590
And the wind is blowing the door.
风吹得门一直在响。

1467
01:05:59.770 --> 01:06:00.730
Whack, whack, whack.
砰，砰，砰。

1468
01:06:00.730 --> 01:06:03.810
And Pam is like, what century is this?
帕姆就想，这到底是哪个世纪啊？

1469
01:06:04.110 --> 01:06:05.030
I know.
我知道。

1470
01:06:05.230 --> 01:06:11.150
Well, Paul told me this is one of his favorite shots from this episode because it's all one
保罗告诉我这是他在这集里最喜欢的镜头之一，因为这是一个完整的

1471
01:06:11.150 --> 01:06:13.770
long tracking shot and they had to time it out.
长跟拍镜头，他们必须掐准时间。

1472
01:06:13.970 --> 01:06:19.310
They had to, you know, rack focus from Pam out to the outhouse.
他们得，你知道，把焦点从帕姆身上平滑地转到茅房那边。

1473
01:06:19.670 --> 01:06:26.170
And, oh, poor Mike Schur had to sit out there and just wait for us every time we would reset.
而且，噢，可怜的迈克·舒尔每次我们重拍时都得坐在外面等着。

1474
01:06:26.710 --> 01:06:30.530
I mean, again, he's like, put through the ringer in this episode.
我是说，他又一次在这集里被折腾得够呛。

1475
01:06:30.730 --> 01:06:32.490
You know, it was cold out there.
你知道，外面很冷。

1476
01:06:33.130 --> 01:06:33.890
Oh, yeah.
噢，是啊。

1477
01:06:34.230 --> 01:06:34.850
Oh, yeah.
噢，是啊。

1478
01:06:35.030 --> 01:06:41.690
Now, I want to point out in an earlier episode when Dwight is telling us about Shroop Farms,
现在，我想指出在之前的一集中，当德怀特跟我们介绍施鲁特农场时，

1479
01:06:42.750 --> 01:06:46.490
he says that there's only one bathroom and it's under the porch.
他说只有一个厕所，而且是在门廊下面。

1480
01:06:47.570 --> 01:06:48.910
Oh, nice catch.
噢，观察得真仔细。

1481
01:06:48.910 --> 01:06:56.530
So, I like to think that maybe when he decided to do the B&B, he upgraded to an outhouse.
所以我喜欢认为，也许当他决定开民宿时，他升级到了一个茅房。

1482
01:06:56.730 --> 01:06:58.110
A proper outhouse.
一个正儿八经的茅房。

1483
01:06:58.290 --> 01:06:58.610
Yes.
没错。

1484
01:06:58.910 --> 01:07:04.230
This is my backstory for the Shroop Farms outhouse.
这就是我为施鲁特农场茅房编的背景故事。

1485
01:07:04.470 --> 01:07:06.390
So, they figure out what that sound is.
所以，他们弄清楚了那是什么声音。

1486
01:07:06.530 --> 01:07:08.430
So, now Jim and Pam are going to go back to bed.
现在吉姆和帕姆打算回床上睡觉了。

1487
01:07:08.430 --> 01:07:12.630
But now there's like a wailing, like a moaning.
但这时又传来一阵哀号声，就像呻吟一样。

1488
01:07:13.330 --> 01:07:13.750
Yes.
没错。

1489
01:07:13.930 --> 01:07:15.790
I mean, it's like, what is that noise?
我是说，那到底是什么声音？

1490
01:07:16.030 --> 01:07:17.770
And so, Jim, it's like his turn.
所以，轮到吉姆了。

1491
01:07:18.110 --> 01:07:19.730
So, he's going to check it out.
于是他去查看情况。

1492
01:07:20.170 --> 01:07:23.390
Well, at 15 minutes, 40 seconds, he approaches a door.
在15分40秒时，他走向一扇门。

1493
01:07:23.710 --> 01:07:26.690
Did you notice the wooden plaque says private room?
你注意到那个木牌上写着“私人房间”了吗？

1494
01:07:27.330 --> 01:07:27.570
Yes.
注意到了。

1495
01:07:27.570 --> 01:07:28.290
Right?
对吧？

1496
01:07:28.610 --> 01:07:28.990
Yes.
没错。

1497
01:07:29.190 --> 01:07:35.010
And he goes in and Dwight is holding the chair figurine and moaning.
他走进去，发现德怀特正拿着那个椅子小雕像在呻吟。

1498
01:07:35.430 --> 01:07:42.790
But very briefly, and I'm talking very briefly, at 15 minutes, 52 seconds, over Jim's shoulder,
但非常短暂，我是说非常短暂，在15分52秒时，从吉姆的肩膀上方，

1499
01:07:43.090 --> 01:07:45.250
you can see a little bit of a poster.
你可以看到一点点海报。

1500
01:07:45.930 --> 01:07:46.470
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1501
01:07:46.590 --> 01:07:48.670
And I zoomed in on this poster.
我放大了这张海报。

1502
01:07:49.570 --> 01:07:52.350
And the legs, it looks like a rock and roll band.
看那腿，看起来像个摇滚乐队。

1503
01:07:52.350 --> 01:07:57.650
And the legs of the pants are white with gray stripes, like skin-tight pants.
裤腿是白底灰条纹的，就像紧身裤一样。

1504
01:07:57.970 --> 01:07:59.930
You can't really make out the face.
你没法看清脸。

1505
01:08:00.070 --> 01:08:02.050
But I got obsessed with these pants.
但我对这条裤子着了迷。

1506
01:08:02.510 --> 01:08:07.330
And I started looking up every Motley Crue poster I could find because I'm positive it's
我开始搜索我能找到的每一张克鲁小丑乐队的海报，因为我肯定那是

1507
01:08:07.330 --> 01:08:08.410
Motley Crue, right?
克鲁小丑乐队，对吧？

1508
01:08:08.610 --> 01:08:09.070
It's Dwight.
是德怀特。

1509
01:08:09.570 --> 01:08:11.250
It's got to be Motley Crue.
那一定是克鲁小丑乐队。

1510
01:08:12.670 --> 01:08:13.970
I'm telling you it is.
我跟你说就是他们。

1511
01:08:14.070 --> 01:08:19.450
I found a photo of Tommy Lee in the same white, skin-tight, stripy pants.
我找到了一张汤米·李穿着同样白色、紧身、条纹裤子的照片。

1512
01:08:19.450 --> 01:08:26.370
And there is no doubt in my mind that in the private room, the love sanctuary of Angela
我毫不怀疑在安吉拉和德怀特的私人房间，

1513
01:08:26.370 --> 01:08:28.570
and Dwight, that there's a Motley Crue poster.
那个爱之圣殿里，有一张克鲁小丑乐队的海报。

1514
01:08:29.230 --> 01:08:37.130
If you remember on their album, Decade of Decadence, 81-91, there's a song called Angela.
如果你还记得他们81-91年的精选集《十年颓废》，里面有一首歌叫《安吉拉》。

1515
01:08:37.250 --> 01:08:39.050
It's going to come into play later.
这之后会派上用场。

1516
01:08:39.370 --> 01:08:40.230
Sam, hit it.
萨姆，放出来。

1517
01:08:51.140 --> 01:08:51.680
Wow.
哇。

1518
01:08:52.080 --> 01:08:52.560
Yeah.
是啊。

1519
01:08:52.900 --> 01:08:56.560
That poster of Motley Crue, you know what that means to Dwight.
那张克鲁小丑乐队的海报，你知道这对德怀特意味着什么。

1520
01:08:56.680 --> 01:08:57.460
It's his lady.
那是他的女人。

1521
01:08:57.700 --> 01:08:58.940
It's his heavy metal.
那是他的重金属音乐。

1522
01:08:59.180 --> 01:09:04.180
And fans that have watched the show all the way through, I don't want to do any spoilers.
对于那些把剧集看完的粉丝，我不想剧透。

1523
01:09:04.520 --> 01:09:06.880
That song's going to come back in a big way later.
那首歌之后会以一种重要的方式回归。

1524
01:09:07.700 --> 01:09:08.240
Wow.
哇。

1525
01:09:08.900 --> 01:09:09.440
Wow.
哇。

1526
01:09:10.620 --> 01:09:13.160
Well, I'll tell you what I noticed in this scene.
好吧，我来说说我在这场戏里注意到的东西。

1527
01:09:13.940 --> 01:09:19.920
At 16 minutes, we have got a huge Dwight from Jim.
在16分钟的时候，吉姆对德怀特说了一个重音的“德怀特”。

1528
01:09:21.540 --> 01:09:28.040
But then at the end of the scene, when he's leaving the room, he throws out a regular Dwight.
但在这场戏结束时，当他离开房间时，他随口说了一个普通的“德怀特”。

1529
01:09:28.320 --> 01:09:28.900
No.
不。

1530
01:09:29.280 --> 01:09:32.880
We have a Dwight and a Dwight in the same scene.
我们在同一场戏里听到了两种不同的“德怀特”。

1531
01:09:32.880 --> 01:09:34.960
He never said Dwight.
他从没说过德怀特。

1532
01:09:35.220 --> 01:09:36.700
He always said Dwight.
他总是说德怀特。

1533
01:09:37.080 --> 01:09:39.820
Is this the one time John says Dwight?
这是约翰唯一一次说德怀特吗？

1534
01:09:40.380 --> 01:09:43.200
Well, I listened to it several times.
嗯，我听了好几遍。

1535
01:09:43.200 --> 01:09:43.980
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1536
01:09:44.120 --> 01:09:45.420
Because this is our job.
因为这就是我们的工作。

1537
01:09:45.420 --> 01:09:47.380
You're listening to that over and over.
你一直在反复听那个。

1538
01:09:47.520 --> 01:09:51.480
